# These special lines allow us to embed default values for the columns above.
# Any column without a default mapping here will simply substitute a `.` to the empty string

# No -Werror for C++: GCC 15 targeting riscv64 reports -Warray-bounds in LLVM's headers
# (llvm/ADT/PointerIntPair.h), which it does not for the other targets.
# Cross-compiled, with the riscv64 parts of the build (system image, pkgimages, docs)
# running under qemu-user, mostly single-threaded: 3.5 to 5 hours on the amdci builders
# (slowest on amdci4), including the bounds-checked stdlib companion pkgimages
# The optimized build compiles LLVM three times and runs the instrumented stage 1 under
# qemu as well; it took ~1.75x a plain build on a local 24-core host. It has no -Werror,
# as its stages compile with clang.
#default TIMEOUT 420
